{"slug":"dd-l-l","ar":"ض ل ل","total":191,"core":"going astray; error; being lost","forms":[{"ar":"أَضَلَّ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":64,"gloss":"To lead astray, send astray","word":"adalla","ex":{"s":26,"a":99,"p":2,"ar":["وَمَآ","أَضَلَّنَآ","إِلَّا","ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ"],"en":"And no one misguided us except the criminals"}},{"ar":"ضَلَّ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":53,"gloss":"to go astray; to be lost","word":null,"ex":{"s":37,"a":71,"p":2,"ar":["وَلَقَدْ","ضَلَّ","قَبْلَهُمْ","أَكْثَرُ","ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ"],"en":"And there had already strayed before them most of the former peoples"}},{"ar":"ضَلَٰل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":38,"gloss":"Misguidance, error","word":"67","ex":{"s":36,"a":24,"p":4,"ar":["إِنِّىٓ","إِذًا","لَّفِى","ضَلَـٰلٍ","مُّبِينٍ"],"en":"Indeed, I would then be in manifest error"}},{"ar":"ضَآلّ","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":14,"gloss":"astray, lost","word":null,"ex":{"s":93,"a":7,"p":2,"ar":["وَوَجَدَكَ","ضَآلًّا","فَهَدَىٰ"],"en":"And He found you lost and guided [you]"}},{"ar":"أَضَلّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":9,"gloss":"more astray","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":72,"p":10,"ar":["وَمَن","كَانَ","فِى","هَـٰذِهِۦٓ","أَعْمَىٰ","فَهُوَ","فِى","ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","أَعْمَىٰ","وَأَضَلُّ","سَبِيلًا"],"en":"And whoever is blind in this [life] will be blind in the Hereafter and more astray in way"}},{"ar":"ضَلَٰلَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":9,"gloss":"error, straying","word":null,"ex":{"s":7,"a":61,"p":5,"ar":["قَالَ","يَـٰقَوْمِ","لَيْسَ","بِى","ضَلَـٰلَةٌ","وَلَـٰكِنِّى","رَسُولٌ","مِّن","رَّبِّ","ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ"],"en":"[Noah] said, \"O my people, there is not error in me, but I am a messenger from the Lord of the worlds"}},{"ar":"مُّضِلّ","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":3,"gloss":"misleader","word":null,"ex":{"s":39,"a":37,"p":7,"ar":["وَمَن","يَهْدِ","ٱللَّهُ","فَمَا","لَهُۥ","مِن","مُّضِلٍّ ۗ","أَلَيْسَ","ٱللَّهُ","بِعَزِيزٍ","ذِى","ٱنتِقَامٍ"],"en":"And whoever Allah guides - for him there is n